    "caption": "I wanted to create a look that feels cinematic, moody and slightly nostalgic \u2014 without taking away the natural feel of the scene. All of these photos were shot on the Sony A7 V with the FE 70\u2013200mm f/2.8 GM OSS II. The goal was to use the light, compression and shallow depth of field to isolate the subjects and turn everyday moments into something more cinematic. And at the end of the carousel, I\u2019ve left you the exact Lightroom settings I used to create this look \u2014 from the basic adjustments to curves, color grading and calibration. Save it for your next edit. \ud83d\udcf8 Shot on SONY A7 V Lens: FE 70\u2013200mm f/2.8 GM OSS II Edited in Lightroom #sonya7v #sonyphotography #lisbon #lisbonphotography #lightroom",
